      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Beach_City%2C_Texas"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "McCollum Park in Beach City is located on the historic home site of early pioneer Solomon Barrow.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
